        <body>
            <div xml:id="d287-a1">

                <pb facs="d287-02" n="2" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76ve01/d287-02"/>

                <head>Attachment<lb/>Memorandum From the President’s Assistant for National Security
                    Affairs (Kissinger) to President Nixon</head>
                <dateline><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1969-05-16">May 16, 1969</date></dateline>
                <pb facs="d287-03" n="3" xml:id="d287-03"/>
                <p>SUBJECT: Implementation, of your NATO Proposals</p>
                <p>Attached at Tab A is a progress report on the implementation of the three
                    proposals you made in your speech of April 10 to the NATO Ministers. Our
                    ambassadors are now in the process of laying the groundwork in NATO capitals so
                    that our NATO delegation will be in a position to submit formal proposals—to the
                    North Atlantic Council.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
